[{"client_msg_id":"7c881db7-1345-4de3-9910-3708391796d7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"次を左に曲がってUターンしようと思ったら、なかなか左にも右にも曲がれなくなって、かと言って引き返すと負けた気がするから曲がれるところまで行ってから帰ろうと思ったら結局18kmくらい走らされたことありますね・・・\n膝が途中でいたくなって後半5kmくらいは完全に歩きだったけど","ts":"1620743477.385300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lOi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b668df6-67e8-4e1e-8098-edff2999a4b6","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私同じ道だと飽きるから毎回変えますね。個人的には迷子好き","ts":"1620743225.382900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2GK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de60b62a-d95d-4cf3-9c4c-e4afff7d2427","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"迷うの、わかる","ts":"1620743040.382300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"poJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51731a0d-72df-445e-be1e-94c4fb6bfcd9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"www","ts":"1620735547.381700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SkAf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fed85a4-0fb7-4e16-b6e9-2d65e612f01f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"出張先で走ったら土地勘無さすぎて迷う迷う。:cyclone:","ts":"1620735459.381500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hIiB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab6d753a-e75e-4382-b2e6-941b67035b79","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://blog.a-know.me/entry/2020/03/04/222916\u003e\nこれはわかりやすいのかも","ts":"1620708173.380600","attachments":[{"fallback":"えいのうにっき: リングフィットアドベンチャーの活動量を Pixela で記録している話 - えいのうにっき","id":1,"title":"リングフィットアドベンチャーの活動量を Pixela で記録している話 - えいのうにっき","title_link":"https://blog.a-know.me/entry/2020/03/04/222916","text":"今年の1月に、リングフィットアドベンチャーを購入しまして。毎朝起きてしばらくして、目が覚めてきたらプレイするようにしています。 リングフィット アドベンチャー -Switch発売日: 2019/10/18メディア: Video Game こういうのは継続してナンボであり、そのモチベーション維持をどうするか？ってことを考えると、これこそ自作の趣味サービス、Pixela の出番じゃん！ってことで、日々の活動の記録をPixelaで残してみています。 \u003chttp://blog.a-know.me|blog.a-know.me\u003e \u003chttp://pixe.la|pixe.la\u003e","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/a/a-know/20200304/20200304162525.png","blocks":null,"ts":1583328556,"service_name":"えいのうにっき","service_icon":"https://blog.a-know.me/icon/touch","from_url":"https://blog.a-know.me/entry/2020/03/04/222916","original_url":"https://blog.a-know.me/entry/2020/03/04/222916"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jVTZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d47cd9a-21c4-4313-b814-1c775701e84f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":sasumatsu:","ts":"1620702238.379300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XfS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc8b8673-d3dc-4d40-ba3d-c9d78ec3c42a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕なんか今日、泊まりの出張に来てるのにランニングシューズ持って来てますからね。","ts":"1620702090.379000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","UD1FQV38V","U01PMN2BVJQ","U017BU3UZBQ"]},{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iOEiJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3b271ba-011d-450d-8add-8ed26746d970","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"楽しければどれでもいいかな。","ts":"1620702046.378900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=4/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8f85e13-cf5a-4591-aa7e-ddaa13458e8f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、ランとかスイムとか、定型がわかりやすいやつは変に見えないだろうとおもうのでいいかな...\n数値化されやすいウェイトのあるやつとかが(自分はいいけど)相手からの目線でちょっと気になるくらい\nでZumbaみたいなリア充なのはまったく見せたくないw","ts":"1620698945.378300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R4BkL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85f83b0f-d76a-48d5-bae4-1e9df1fa8efa","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"10年ぶりくらいに泳ぎたいけど、視線が気になってしまって無理そう…","ts":"1620698807.376900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ypb2Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0a07af9-18fc-4de6-bb68-9376e8b35598","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ジムとかでも新しく来た人がマシンの使い方よくわからなくて面白い感じに使ってる（背筋マシンの間に挟まってみたりとか）のを微笑ましく見てる","ts":"1620698751.376000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AbW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DFD30A04-2B48-45D6-896F-BCBB14C5E1FA","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"ジム通いしてた頃もそれのせいでペース崩れまくりだったなあ\n存在を感じる程度ならむしろ良いけれど、視線は感じたくない","ts":"1620698729.375900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4Q5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"890483ad-9fd6-49d7-bf37-af91ff2d70d6","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"最初のころ見られたくないの超わかるw","ts":"1620698603.372900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OsuT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9486cb7-2fc9-4884-afaa-07045fcf3213","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ランニングはともかく、ほかのあらゆるフィットネス見られたくない気持ちはあるので、その意味では差がないな(自宅でやることになる)\nとはいえ、スペースがいるよなあ","ts":"1620698463.372400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GTazO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BB3BACF9-0583-4A3F-BC69-0E55D2C7AE8B","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"まあたしかまだ20代半ばだったと思うし、若いからこそ手を出しやすい系統のエクササイズかと","ts":"1620698409.371500","edited":{"user":"U81LLJ340","ts":"1620698467.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hl0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79c4d99f-5b0f-4d69-aa1c-9ca588b0abe3","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"Zumbaリア充しかできない認識あるw","ts":"1620698328.370100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8lAd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F93D7D65-5CA1-400C-9429-09B1B91DC692","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"Zumbaは知人の奥さんがだいぶハマっているらしい\n有酸素ばかりだろうけれど、運動量もなかなかなそうで","ts":"1620698301.369700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xcC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00ed3208-4956-459b-9568-cdeb170c314d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"リングフィット、継続しなかったな…\n逆に、毎日10分筋トレは継続している","ts":"1620697997.367900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=3Mv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab65e3cf-5986-4b76-a80a-48d81db1809d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"運動習慣や基礎体力にはよさそうですもんね\nヨッピーさんみたいに、ある程度慣れたら追加で別のフィットネスゲームとかがいいのかな\n\u003chttps://travel.spot-app.jp/switchdiet_yoppy/\u003e","ts":"1620697747.367200","attachments":[{"fallback":"SPOT(スポット): 「Nintendo Switch ダイエット」4か月間レポート！結論から言うと「痩せる」","id":1,"title":"「Nintendo Switch ダイエット」4か月間レポート！結論から言うと「痩せる」","title_link":"https://travel.spot-app.jp/switchdiet_yoppy/","text":"Nintendo Swich™のダイエット向けソフト「Zumba®　de 脂肪燃焼！」などを実際に4か月プレイレポート！他のSwitchのソフトとの比較も。結論を言うと40歳に近いおじさんが実際に10キロほど痩せ、筋肉量が増加しました。","image_url":"https://d1uyv6v1bosv8j.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/20120612/b751935f0169f423493f7afbedc7b46d1-1280x718.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1597893091,"service_name":"SPOT(スポット)","from_url":"https://travel.spot-app.jp/switchdiet_yoppy/","original_url":"https://travel.spot-app.jp/switchdiet_yoppy/"}],"edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1620697761.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HOF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c43b6ca8-4429-4e4d-84bd-aa220e0fd1a0","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ結局どこまでやるかですけど","ts":"1620697516.366100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2rFI0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f919a8c8-80c5-49e7-8c91-9f40ed103c5e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"個人的にはリングフィット導入にはすごくいいと思ってて、運動してない状態からトレーニングできる体作るまでが割ときつくて挫折する部分だったりするから、そこを楽しくやってある程度基礎の体作ってから卒業していくスタイルが体変えていくには勝ちパターンなんじゃと思ってます。","ts":"1620697515.365900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3W33"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14dea943-0557-447d-948b-1e3025a9e4ba","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"リングフィットでもうキツキツなので私には普通のトレーニング無理だな…","ts":"1620696497.362000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RLXzy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"128e58b4-97e8-4713-89aa-63ecd34f768c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ強度と時間によりそうですけど、普通のトレーニングよりは軽いという意味で・・・","ts":"1620694886.361600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iVSI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3cd6a44-0d09-4273-8d61-dd91d9703a1a","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"リングフィットが軽い運動… :thinking_face:","ts":"1620694849.360900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DqcY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f44d6d82-20ca-4162-a698-ae62ca16f5ae","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"あと食事前に軽い運動すると食欲がリセットされて暴食しなくて済むってのは聞きますね。リングフィットくらいのやつ","ts":"1620694808.360400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aJT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"763607a7-ab8d-4917-a06c-512c79a18a3f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"平均以上食べてる場合は落とした方がいいと思いますけど、食事制限は割とつらいし気を配るところも多かったりするんで続かないケースが多いから、ある程度はアウトを上げるしかないですね・・・","ts":"1620694641.359200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/cKm+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"940e97be-3031-4ba7-9325-a46fa233f1aa","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"食べないと体力落ちるんだなぁと最近感じる…","ts":"1620694612.358900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dQ1R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af326fc3-de2f-445c-ac46-3c2ab2d56737","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただそれでも運動しないことに比べて運動する時点ですでに数倍 \u003c#C01BXG2FGD8|life-healthcare\u003e なので、走るのは良い :goodpoem:","ts":"1620694382.357100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mn6Ma"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d850218-7d94-4040-9b83-ca9dc1c0f47c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt;  1日だいたい 1400~2000kcal くらい御飯食べるとして\nやっぱり痩せる人はごはん食べてないんだな…","ts":"1620694368.356700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ISDk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9edbc5d4-53fd-4501-b923-8bd6e8eb7b30","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なので、前いってたこっちの方が \u003c#C01BXG2FGD8|life-healthcare\u003e 的には良いですね \u003chttps://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1318307.html\u003e","ts":"1620694356.355900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Impress Watch: 時速7kmの「早歩き」はランニングより高負荷・低リスク アシックス","id":1,"title":"時速7kmの「早歩き」はランニングより高負荷・低リスク アシックス","title_link":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1318307.html","text":"アシックスは、ウォーキングシューズブランド「WELLNESS WALKER」により「ファーストウォーキング(早歩き)」を推進するイベントを開催した。","image_url":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/img/ipw/list/1318/307/asicsogp.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1618294515,"service_name":"Impress Watch","service_icon":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1318307.html","original_url":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1318307.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ui3NW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ee42c82-d0b8-4427-b2ba-28bb1bb5b11d","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"筋肉量増加して体重上がっちゃうと膝とか股関節とか足首に負担いっちゃうんですよね。どうしても。","ts":"1620694283.355400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EPTL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8da1ae80-62f2-48d2-848e-9b3a3a26c091","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"筋肉分解はされると思いますね。ランナーの体つき見てたらわかるしジムとか行ってもマッチョはぜんぜん走ってない。\n体大きくしたいなら走らなくてもいいかと。運動前と後に軽く走るのは悪くないと思いますけど（筋肥大的にも健康でいるためにも）。","ts":"1620694204.354200","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620694385.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OuvS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d112bfab-06bf-4594-8c1c-b061664b0d12","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"筋肉の分解は実際ありそうなので僕はほどほどにやってます（1日おきに30分程度）","ts":"1620693018.352100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xC716"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e7f13ec-28c1-488b-a45a-db8e7e01f28f","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"ジョギングは楽しそうですが、コルチゾールというストレスホルモンが分泌されやすくなって、老化の加速や筋肉の分解が発生するとのことなので及び腰になってます。","ts":"1620692852.351400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j2K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ade3ed39-023e-4a54-957f-0427e0d9b0a1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"1日だいたい 1400~2000kcal くらい御飯食べるとして、息して生きてるだけで 1700~1800kcal くらい消費しますね。残り歩いたりで丁度になるので歩かないとあまった分で太る。ランニングがだいたい 7~8km 走って 400~500kcal 消費(僕の場合) なので痩せてく感じ。","ts":"1620682905.350300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0yno"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a7750b0-12a6-4e10-9cde-20ebf76b1040","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"痩せる為には摂取カロリー減らすことが一番大事ですけど、\n過度にやり過ぎない限り運動やってマイナスになることは無いですからね","ts":"1620669948.350100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"znk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9409b564-47e7-4674-bfbd-7cac3e9c9ec9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"運動では消費カロリーが少ない、そう思ってた時期が僕にもありました","ts":"1620661976.348700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v=+D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dac586d-44d0-4f50-af79-860a7a3b9ef1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"キツソー...。持ってもらってないと上がらんやん。","ts":"1620659833.348300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hMDx/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46bd8ccc-6ca4-42d6-88d5-8d28ba69473e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"３回目くらいで殴るw","ts":"1620659703.347800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ImbB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a2ea752-560d-4e50-a839-6c7112d146a6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ダンベルで殴れる体力残ってないやん","ts":"1620659671.347400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pU6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6dd2210-8dd5-4c32-a9be-236a7c8c90ca","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"18kg 軽めといってたこの人がこの後...","ts":"1620659541.346900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dmFH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81a4a6a5-05eb-4e43-aa82-150956389ad7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yndhHLYL3IY\u0026amp;t=244s\u003e","ts":"1620659529.346400","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 大胸筋上部を山本式３/７法で鍛える。絶対に大胸筋に効くオススメの種目です。","id":1,"author_name":"山澤 礼明【筋肉チャンネル】","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuhPVNbY5AATKsU5RSEhbCQ","title":"大胸筋上部を山本式３/７法で鍛える。絶対に大胸筋に効くオススメの種目です。","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yndhHLYL3IY\u0026amp;t=244s","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yndhHLYL3IY/hqdefault.jpg","